  ],
  "intro": "The NSW Government is committed to ensuring our veterans, past and present, are honoured with dignity and respect. A range of programs, services and concessions is available for veterans and their families to help them transition from military to civilian life and to help them save on everyday costs.\n\nSome services, programs and concessions are available to all veterans, while others are only available to veterans who meet specific requirements, such as holding a DVA Veteran Gold Card printed with TPI (Totally and Permanently Incapacitated) or EDA (Extreme Disablement Adjustment).\n\nTo browse other NSW Government rebates and savings, visit Savings Finder.",
